cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this knowledge graph, please cite it as below."
title: "Medical Device Design Knowledge Graph"
abstract: >-
  An RDF knowledge graph unifying United States FDA medical device data across
  premarket review, product classification, recognized standards, recalls,
  adverse events, postmarket studies, establishment registrations and facility
  records, published on the NSF Proto-OKN Fabric to support evidence-informed
  medical device design.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://registry.okn.us/registry/kgs/medical-device-kg/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/medical-device-design/medical-device-kg"
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://purl.org/okn/frink/kg/medical-device-kg"
    description: Persistent identifier for the graph
keywords:
  - medical devices
  - knowledge graph
  - RDF
  - SPARQL
  - FDA
  - biomedical engineering
  - device design
  - regulatory science
  - open knowledge network

